OL,3,GNEWSASpider discovery like uncovering
OL,4,A'hidden treasure'
OL,5,
OL,6,FScientists have said they are
OL,7,F"completely stunned" after discovering
OL,8,Fa new species of spider.
OL,10,FA team from Jersey's Durrell Wildlife
OL,11,FConservation Trust was working with
OL,12,Fpartners on the Mauritian island of
OL,13,FIlot Vacoas when the arachnid was
OL,14,Fspotted along a stretch of rock along
OL,15,Fthe coast in 2023.
OL,17,FThe charity said the discovery was
OL,18,Fconfirmed as a new species of trapdoor
OL,19,Fspider which was named the Mauritian
OL,20,Ftidal trapdoor spider (Idioctis
OL,21,Fmarevallum).
OL,23,APub: 31-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
