OL,3,GNEWSASpider discovery like uncovering
OL,4,A'hidden treasure'
OL,5,
OL,6,FDr Max Tercel, the entomologist who
OL,7,Ffound the spider, said it felt like
OL,8,Funcovering a "hidden treasure".
